<p>Akbar Ne Sina Khai Hai Unko Na Batana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>1) Kis Tarhan Se Dekhein Gi Wo Hum Donon Ki Ghurbat<br>
Wo Roye To Aa Jaye Gi Khaimo Main Qayamat<br>
Main Zakhm Chupa Leta Hoon Tum Ansoon Chupana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>2) Tasweer e Muhammad Hai bade Nazo Se Paali<br>
Mar Jaye Na Khaimo Main Meri Palny Wali<br>
Har Giz Ye Mera Hath Na Seeny Se Hatana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>3) Mari Hai Sina Seny Pe Ye Keh Ke Laeen Ne<br>
Phoolon Ki Tarhan Pala Hai Akbar Ko Phuphi Ne<br>
Lashy Pe Abaa Kahimoon Se Pehle Hi Udha Na<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>4) Is Baar Shahadat Ko Utha Le Gi Imamat<br>
Bhai Se Chupana Nahi Ek Bhai Ki Ghurbat<br>
Sajjad Ko Tafseel Shahadat Ki Suna Na<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>5) Mamta Unhein Lashy Pe Mere Laye Gi Baba<br>
Be Sakhta Wo Mujh Se Lipat Jaye Gi Baba<br>
Mumkin Ho Tu Lashy Se Unhein Door Hatana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>6) Ju Khak Bhari Hai Mere Balon Se Chura Do<br>
Chehre Pe Laho Hai Mere Daman Se Hata Do<br>
Wo Zidd Ju Zyada Kary Bas Chehra Dekhana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>7) Yoon Naiza Sitam Gaar Ne Mara Mere Baba<br>
Pehlo Bhi Shikasta Hai Hamara Mere Baba<br>
Yaad Aay Ga Dadi Ka Unhein Zakhm Purana<br>
Baba Phupi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>8) Is Haal Main De Sabr Khuda Bint E Ali Ko<br>
Akbar Ka Salam Akhri Keh Dena Phuphi Ko<br>
Zinda Bara Mushkil Hai Mera Khaimy Main Jana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>9) Har Baat Meri Apki Behnon Ke Liye Hai<br>
Bas Ek Wasiyat Hai Meri Sughra Ke Liye Hai<br>
Laa Kar Khat E Sughra Mere Lashy Pe Sunana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>10) Dam Todte Akbar Ko Na Pohanchy Koi Sadma<br>
Muh Pher ke Yoon Rote Ho Maloom Hai Baba<br>
Par Samny Sadaat ke Ansoon Na Bahana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>

<p>11) Hayeee Us Akhri Hichki Me Taqallum Hoa Mehshar<br>
Ary Akbar Ne Kaha Hath Ju Peshani Pe Rakh Kar<br>
Loo Hum Ko Ijazat Do Hamy Door Hai Jana<br>
Baba Phuphi Amma Se Mera Zakhm Chupana</p>